	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Open Linear issues and searches from Alfred.

ln abc-123          → open issue ABC-123
ln 123              → open issue 123 in your default team
ln redis eviction   → search, or create an issue with that title
ln new fix login    → new issue in your default team, assigned to you
ln mine             → your assigned issues
ln inbox            → inbox
ln team [KEY]       → a team's active issues
ln cycle [KEY]      → a team's current cycle
ln projects         → all projects
ln proj redis       → projects named like "redis" (needs an API key)

Short aliases: s, n, my, in, t, cy, pj.
↩ open in browser · ⌘↩ copy URL · ⌘C copy URL

Set your workspace URL slug, default team key and API key in Configure Workflow.</string>
